            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "At the moment we use TriplyDB so this is the source data: <a href=\"https://data.labs.kadaster.nl/kadaster/kkg \">https://data.labs.kadaster.nl/kadaster/kkg</a>. <br>\nAmong others, the KKG contains data from the Key Register of Addresses and Buildings (BAG), the Key Register of Large-scale Topography (BGT), the Top10NL from the Key Register of Topography (BRT), the Administrative Areas from the Key Register of Cadastres (BRK) and data from the Public Law Restrictions (PB)."
